{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S04、S13等处压缩了人物行为背后的动机，尤其弱化了他想说出心意是为了留住当下、想藏回喜欢是为了避免未来受伤这两层因果，人物心理的解释不如X完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮和话语、感受交替排列，让观众能迅速抓住每段发生了什么，感受又能随音乐实际出现，不必同时处理所有信息。反复出现的船、水波、摇荡、靠岸等意象，加上细致的音乐变化描述，让情绪发展更连贯，听觉与文字也更像同一件事。X在解释人物为什么犹豫、为什么改变方面更扎实，但整体而言，Y更适合边听边看，观众也更容易获得细腻而具体的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1214e0e2-f275-4776-bc1f-cb1d13e4ac50", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T062519528711Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.282, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:26:42.809377+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9586e8508ec700c8eedf5459450819a331b574c785893db575b222844ff9b2cc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp